{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634900/extras/f59dabeeac2ce60c3dfcdce961d32ac8.poster.avif?t=1724158047\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634900/extras/f59dabeeac2ce60c3dfcdce961d32ac8.webm?t=1724158047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634900/extras/f59dabeeac2ce60c3dfcdce961d32ac8.mp4?t=1724158047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Acheron is a fast-paced, brutal old-school FPS inspired by Quake, blending Brutalistic architecture, Lovecraftian alien horrors, and Hellraiser-esque nightmare fuel in a gritty PSX-style aesthetic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634900/extras/af82bc3fc0af157bac6738773e96efc0.poster.avif?t=1724158047\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634900/extras/af82bc3fc0af157bac6738773e96efc0.webm?t=1724158047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634900/extras/af82bc3fc0af157bac6738773e96efc0.mp4?t=1724158047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The world is dead, its ruins ruled by corrupted deities. You rise again with the power of the old gods, reactivated to complete a mission, you will have no doubt, you will execute your task with relentless zeal.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unleash Devastating Firepower: Dual-wield powerful weapons to carve through the remnants of a world in ruins.<br></li><li> Harness Sacred Armaments: Wield &quot;divine&quot; tools of destruction and unleash a tempest of righteous fury<br></li><li> Explore a Dead World: Navigate the decaying corpse of a fallen empire, infested with corrupted deities and dark secrets.<br></li><li> Challenge and Conquer: Face malevolent forces, uncover dark secrets and fulfill your function.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634900/extras/27364841184b276b1cb74b98dbf7e1eb.poster.avif?t=1724158047\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634900/extras/27364841184b276b1cb74b98dbf7e1eb.webm?t=1724158047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634900/extras/27364841184b276b1cb74b98dbf7e1eb.mp4?t=1724158047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1634900?t=1724158047","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1634900?t=1724158047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634900/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1724158047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634900/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1724158047","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2402110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634900/extras/f59dabeeac2ce60c3dfcdce961d32ac8.poster.avif?t=1724158047\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634900/extras/f59dabeeac2ce60c3dfcdce961d32ac8.webm?t=1724158047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s